e"," to"," make"," traveling"," a"," priority"," in"," their"," lives",","," as"," it"," is"," a"," powerful"," way"," to"," learn",","," grow",","," and"," discover"," oneself",".<","|","im","_","end","|>","\n","<","|","im","_","start","|>","user","\n","Can"," you"," please"," add"," some"," more"," examples"," of"," how"," traveling"," can"," broad","en"," our"," perspectives"," and"," expose"," us"," to"," different"," ways"," of"," thinking","?","<","|","im","_","end","|>","\n","<","|","im","_","start","|>","ass","istant","\n","Certainly","!"," One"," of"," the"," most"," powerful"," ways"," that"," travel"," can"," broad","en"," our"," perspectives"," is"," by"," exposing"," us"," to"," different"," ways"," of"," thinking"," and"," living","."," For"," example",","," when"," I"," traveled"," to"," India",","," I"," was"," struck"," by"," the"," importance"," of"," spirituality"," in"," daily"," life","."," Seeing"," people"," engage"," in"," daily"," prayer"," rituals",","," visit"," temples",","," and"," perform"," acts"," of"," kindness"," based"," on"," their"," faith"," was"," deeply"," inspiring"," and"," opened"," my"," eyes"," to"," a"," diffe","ren"]},{"activations":[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.90296,0.0,0.0,0.50779,0.90621,0.83577,0.90332,0.6157,0.9061,0.906,0.88783,0.90655,0.90657,0.0,0.0,0.74683,0.90469,0.70955,0.0,0.81309,0.85217,0.68024,0.8239,0.0,0.0,0.85168,0.85221,0.77495,0.85221,0.85221,0.83024,0.8522,0.0,0.65918,0.85221,0.85221,0.85218,0.76871,0.85221,0.85221,0.85221,0.70927,0.33644,0.85221,0.85221,0.0,0.0,0.8521,0.85221,0.8522,0.85196,0.8512,0.85221,0.85536,0.0,0.0,0.84177,0.83233,0.81259,0.77546,1.04918,0.94536,0.0,0.79268,1.0579,0.80392,0.0,0.97489,0.70027,0.78998,0.77417,0.55675,1.31037,0.84742,1.16449,0.0,1.01065,0.72689,1.14037,0.85114,0.80303,0.0,0.0,0.51123,0.97182,0.98077,0.42777,0.78052,1.17408,0.39687,0.98646,0.74443,0.71531,1.16268,1.30221,0.0,1.2325,0.76493,0.0,0.91473,0.61004,0.77226,0.0,0.84035,0.99453,0.72602,0.0,0.0,0.85189,0.85126,0.83258,