5,"max_token_index":832,"peak_labels":{"hate speech":"none","language":"id","names":"none","part of speech":"none","personal data":"none","postal addresses":"none","source":"fineweb-2","toxicity":"none"},"text":"Koleksi patung lilin tokoh terkenal, Madame Tussauds, kini hadir di Sentosa, Singapura. Anda tidak perlu jauh-jauh ke London, Hongkong atau Bangkok untuk dapat berpose dengan patung tokoh terkenal yang begitu mirip dan berukuran sebenarnya. Mulai dari pemimpin negara, penyanyi, bintang film, atlit olahraga dapat dijumpai di sini.\nLokasi Madame Tussauds ini terletak di Sentosa berdekatan dengan Universal Studio. Kalau Anda naik Sentosa Express monorel, turun di Merlion Station, lalu ikuti petunjuk arah ke Madame Tussauds dengan naik eskalator ke atas (4 kali naik eskalator). Lokasinya terletak di gedung Images of Singapore, dan sekarang ini tiketnya dibuat paket combo antara Images of Singapore Live dengan Madame Tussauds.\nImages of Singapore Live adalah sebuah kisah perjalanan negara Singapura selama 200 tahun yang ditampilkan dalam bentuk paduan setting ruangan, special effect dan para aktor yang menampilkan suasana mulai dari perkampungan nelayan, usaha dagang Four Winds Trading Co, perkampungan peranakan, sampai perkembangan Singapura menjadi kota yang maju.\nSetelah itu pengunjung akan menikmati perjalanan dengan menggunakan perahu untuk melihat The Spirit of Singapore. Kurang lebih seperti masuk istana boneka di Dunia Fantasi Ancol.\nKemudian, siapkan kamera DSLR, kamera saku, atau kamera ponsel Anda karena begitu masuk ke area Madame Tussauds, pengunjung akan sibuk berfoto dengan tokoh idamannya. Tersedia juga beberapa properti seperti wig, kacamata, jaket, kalung, dll yang disesuaikan dengan tokohnya. Semua dapat digunakan bebas dan gratis. Tidak ada batasan waktu untuk berada di ruangan ini, sampai puas dan bosan deh. Patung lilin di dalam biasanya akan diganti secara bergilir dengan Madame Tussauds di negara lain. Dan ada beberapa patung yang “premium” yang biasanya difoto oleh petugas, dan dapat dicetak di pintu keluar jika Anda tertarik menebusnya. Tapi tidak wajib dibeli koq, dan bahkan petugas juga tidak keberatan mengambil foto dengan kamera yang kita bawa (gratisan) 🙂\nPengunjung dapat membeli aneka cinderamata di toko souvenir.\nSeru kan, jangan lewatkan saat Anda berlibur ke Singapura, tapi atur waktu Anda agar jangan sampai waktu bermain di Universal Studio malah habis karena sibuk foto-foto di sini. Untuk memesan tiket ke Madame Tussauds dengan harga yang lebih hemat silahkan menghubungi kami di email@example.com. (Pesan sponsor).\nSalam JJH\nMadame Tussauds\nSenin – Jumat : 10.00 – 18.00\nSabtu & Minggu : 10.00 – 19.30\nHarga tiket masuk : SGD 39 (dewasa), SGD 29 (anak-anak)\nHarga JJH : Rp 220.000 (dewasa & anak-anak)","tokens":["K","ole","ksi"," pat","ung"," l","ilin"," tok","oh"," ter","ken","al",","," Madame"," T","uss","aud","s",","," k","ini"," had","ir"," di"," Sent","osa",","," Sing","ap","ura","."," And","a"," tid","ak"," per","lu"," j","au","h","-","j","au","h"," ke"," London",","," Hong","k","ong"," at","au"," Bangkok"," unt","uk"," d","apat"," ber","pose"," deng","an"," pat","ung"," tok","oh"," ter","ken","al"," yang"," beg","it","u"," mir","ip"," dan"," ber","uk","uran"," se","ben","arn","ya","."," Mul","ai"," d","ari"," p","em","im","pin"," neg","ara",","," pen","y","any","i",","," b","int","ang"," film",","," at","lit"," ol","ahr","aga"," d","apat"," di","jump","ai"," di"," s","ini",".","\n","L","ok","asi"," Madame"," T","uss","aud","s"," ini"," ter","let","ak"," di"," Sent","osa"," ber","de","kat","an"," deng","an"," Universal"," Studio","."," Kal","au"," And","a"," na","ik"," Sent","osa"," Express"," mon","orel",","," tur","un"," di"," Mer","lion"," Station",","," l","al","u"," ik","uti"," pet","un","j","uk"," a","rah"," ke"," Madame"," T","uss","aud","s"," deng","an"," na","ik"," es","kal","ator"," ke"," at","as"," (","4"," k","ali"," na","ik"," es","kal","ator",")."," Lok","as",